   "start_page": 1,
   "summary": "This document constitutes the final portion (pages 190–226) of a comprehensive SCAP CI&E roster and survey of educational institutions in Hokkaido Prefecture. It catalogues town and village elementary schools, private secondary schools (including vocational, middle, and girls' high schools), private youth schools and kindergartens, special schools for the deaf and blind, and technical and youth schools operated under government ministries other than the Ministry of Education. Each entry provides the institution's name, location, foundation date, and detailed breakdown of male, female, and total student enrollments and teaching personnel as of 30 April and 30 November 1946, concluding with a reference map of Hokkaido indicating major urban centers and prefectural institutions.",
